<title>UK: Simon Engineering plans name change.</title>
<headline>Simon Engineering plans name change.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Simon Engineering Plc said on Tuesday that it planned to change its name to Simon Group Plc following the sales of the industrial businesses of its Access division last month.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
